  "title": "REalloys Announces MOU with Ramaco Resources to Advance Rare Earth Production from U.S. Coal-Hosted Resources",
  "summary": "REalloys Inc. (NASDAQ: ALOY) (“REalloys” or the “Company”),a vertically integrated U.S. rare earth processing and magnet supply chain company, today announced the execution of a non-binding Memorandum of Understanding (“MOU”) with Ramaco Resources, Inc. (“Ramaco”) to evaluate a strategic long-term partnership for the supply and commercialization of rare earth and critical mineral products from Ramaco’s Brook Mine operation in Wyoming.",
